---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<figure class="hero-film" data-hero data-film>
  <div class="film-frame">
    <video
      class="film-video"
      data-film-video
      controls
      muted
      loop
      playsinline
      preload="metadata"
      poster="/promo/concise-promo-poster.webp"
      width="1920"
      height="1080"
      aria-describedby="film-description"
    >
      <source src="/promo/concise-promo.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
    </video>
    <button class="film-start" type="button" data-film-start hidden>
      <span class="film-start-icon"><Icon name="play" size={22} /></span>
      Play the 31-second film
    </button>
    <div class="film-controls" data-film-controls hidden>
      <button type="button" class="film-control" data-film-sound aria-pressed="false">
        <span data-film-sound-off><Icon name="sound" size={18} /> Sound on</span>
        <span data-film-sound-on hidden><Icon name="muted" size={18} /> Mute</span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="film-control film-control-icon" data-film-pause aria-label="Pause film">
        <span data-film-pause-icon><Icon name="pause" size={18} /></span>
        <span data-film-play-icon hidden><Icon name="play" size={18} /></span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="film-caption">
    <p id="film-description" class="visually-hidden">A 31-second film: Concise checks it first. Kinetic phrases give way to three real hook messages and the web console. Read the film transcript below for the checks and example revisions.</p>
    <details class="film-transcript">
      <summary>Read the film transcript</summary>
      <div class="film-transcript-body">
        <p>Stock agent phrases pile into a wall. An orange stroke splits it: “Concise checks it first.” Three checks follow, using real hook output on sample writes. The revisions illustrate what the agent could write next; Concise does not rewrite files or commit messages.</p>
        <h3>Comments</h3>
        <p>A four-line comment in <code>src/invoice.ts</code> is denied. The on-screen message reads:</p>
        <blockquote><code>[concise] Comment at …/src/invoice.ts:1 is 4 lines (limit 2).</code></blockquote>
        <p>The example revision is <code>// Amounts are integer cents; never floats.</code></p>
        <h3>Commit messages</h3>
        <p><strong>Optional: AI-writing checks are disabled by default.</strong> This example enables them and flags three phrases in “Leverage a robust, seamless approach to streamline invoice rounding.”</p> <!-- taste-skill-ignore: quotes the input being checked -->
        <blockquote><code>[concise] 3 AI writing patterns in commit message.</code></blockquote>
        <p>The example revision is “Round invoice totals to whole cents.”</p>
        <h3>Pull requests</h3>
        <p>A three-paragraph PR body is denied. The film abbreviates the hook message:</p>
        <blockquote><code>[concise] PR/issue body is too verbose: 3 prose paragraphs (limit 1), …</code></blockquote>
        <p>The example revision is “Rounds invoice totals to whole cents and updates the rounding tests.”</p>
        <h3>The web console</h3>
        <p>Real Live activity and Overview screens show the sample checks. “Watch every check.” Start the console with <code>concise-web --all</code>.</p>
        <p>The film closes on “Your agent. Less verbose.”, the Concise mark, <code>/plugin install concise@be-concise</code>, and <a href="https://github.com/yannelli/be-concise">github.com/yannelli/be-concise</a>. For the complete setup, see <a href="/docs/installation/">installation instructions</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .film-caption { margin-top: 12px; }
  .film-transcript summary { width: fit-content; cursor: pointer; padding: 8px 0; font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); }
  .film-transcript summary:hover { color: var(--ink); }
  .film-transcript:not([open]) > .film-transcript-body { display: none; }
  .film-transcript-body { max-width: 70ch; margin: 12px auto 28px; padding: 24px; background: var(--soft); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .film-transcript-body h3 { font-size: 24px; margin: 28px 0 12px; }
  .film-transcript-body p + p { margin-top: 14px; }
  .film-transcript-body blockquote { margin: 16px 0; padding: 16px; background: var(--surface); }
  .film-transcript-body code { font-size: .85em; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .film-transcript-body a { text-decoration: underline; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  @media (max-width: 550px) { .film-caption { padding-inline: 10px; } .film-transcript-body { padding: 18px; } }
</style>
